             <Text>
              <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Zulage für Entsorgung Boden</span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">TOC &#x3e; 3% bis 6% und DOC &#x3c; 25 mg/l (EPP).</span>
